# When another program deletes the project Quick Add was adding to, Enter adds nothing and asks for a project again.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
Garden:
	- Rake leaves
END
keys qq
type Mow /gar
see Garden
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → Garden
outside <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
hide Rake leaves
keys <Enter>
see Choose a project with /
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
